id: date/offset/0001
area: date
op: LocalTime and getTimezoneOffset agree
in: f64:0x42525DE2B5700000
out: value: bool:true
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-localtime spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.prototype.gettimezoneoffset spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.utc ref:dateref@1
script: var d = new Date(315538200000); (Date.UTC(d.getFullYear(), d.getMonth(), d.getDate(), d.getHours(), d.getMinutes(), d.getSeconds(), d.getMilliseconds()) - d.getTime()) / 60000 === -d.getTimezoneOffset()
note: the local fields are LocalTime(t)'s and the offset is (t - LocalTime(t)) / msPerMinute, in every zone
since: 14

