id: date/date-only/0001
area: date
op: Date.parse, a date-only form is UTC
in: str:"1970-01-01"
out: value: bool:true
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.parse spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date-time-string-format spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.utc ref:dateref@1
script: Date.parse("1970-01-01") === Date.UTC(1970, 0, 1)
note: a date-only form is a UTC time in every zone (correspondence row P1)
since: 14

id: date/date-time/0001
area: date
op: Date.parse, a date-time form is local time
in: str:"1970-01-01T12:30"
out: value: bool:true
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.parse spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date-time-string-format spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-utc-t ref:dateref@1
script: Date.parse("1970-01-01T12:30") === new Date(1970, 0, 1, 12, 30).getTime()
note: a date-time form without an offset and the constructor from components read one local time, in every zone (correspondence row L2)
since: 14

